# Fastlane
# Mirrors apps/mobile/.gitignore: the desktop release lane regenerates these on
# every run, and without ignoring them the primary checkout is left dirty after
# each release — where a `git add -A` sweeps them into an unrelated commit.
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots
fastlane/test_output
fastlane/README.md
